# lfs-utils
### The utilities of /opt/lfs-utils for a system the framework built, run by hand as root: growroot.sh
### grows the partition of / to the end of its disk (an image written on a larger card or disk).
### sfdisk and partx come from lfs/util-linux, the resize of the file system from the programs of its
### type (lfs/e2fsprogs, lfs/btrfs-progs), which the project builds; lfs/dracut adds dracut-hostonly.sh
PKG_VER=1.0
PKG_DEPS="lfs/util-linux"
BUILD_PROCESS=none
PKG_TOOLCHAIN=gnu
